{"id":47396,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47396"},"modified":"2026-10-27T14:59:36","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T13:59:36","slug":"trail-demonios-do-lizandro","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-demonios-do-lizandro\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro 2026<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>6 e 7 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na localidade de <strong>Alvarinhos<\/strong> (freguesia de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o das Lampas), no concelho de <strong>Sintra<\/strong> e distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Com toda a log\u00edstica de secretariado, partidas, chegadas e banhos centralizada no <strong>Futebol Clube de Alvarinhos<\/strong>, o programa abre na noite de sexta-feira (6 de novembro) \u00e0s <strong>22:00<\/strong> com a partida do exigente 1\u00ba Trail Endurance de 100 km, prosseguindo na manh\u00e3 de s\u00e1bado (7 de novembro) com as restantes dist\u00e2ncias a partir das <strong>08:00<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos d\u00e3o a conhecer a riqueza natural dos vales e encostas do <strong>rio Lizandro<\/strong> e a paisagem rural saloia do norte do concelho de Sintra. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o desdobra-se em seis dist\u00e2ncias distintas: o <strong>Trail Endurance de 100 km<\/strong> (tempo limite de 24 horas, acolhendo o Campeonato Regional de Trail Endurance da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa), o <strong>Ultra Trail de 50 km<\/strong> (limite de 10 horas), o <strong>Trail Longo de 30 km<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Sprint de 20 km<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini Trail de 12 km<\/strong> e uma <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela equipa <strong>Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro<\/strong>, o evento possui certifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial <strong>ITRA<\/strong>, \u00e9 pontu\u00e1vel para o <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong> e integra o calend\u00e1rio do <strong>Circuito Nacional da ATRP<\/strong> e do Circuito Regional da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui refei\u00e7\u00e3o final, medalha <em>finisher<\/em>, dorsal personalizado, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, duches e transporte para a meta em caso de abandono, prevendo ainda descontos especiais para atletas com elevado \u00edndice de competitividade ITRA.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6 a 7 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Campo de Futebol de Alvarinhos (S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o das Lampas), Sintra, Lisboa<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; lette