#34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 17.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 25\/10)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 12K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 7 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/02)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 01\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 25\/10)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 5\u00ba Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro decorre nos dias 6 e 7 de novembro de 2026, com partidas no Campo de Futebol de Alvarinhos (S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o das Lampas, Sintra). Na sexta-feira, 6 de novembro, parte o Trail Endurance 100 km \u00e0s 22:00. No s\u00e1bado, 7 de novembro, partem o Ultra Trail 50 km \u00e0s 08:00, o Trail Longo 30 km \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Sprint 20 km \u00e0s 09:00, o Mini Trail 12 km \u00e0s 09:30 e a Caminhada 12 km \u00e0s 09:45.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, certifica\u00e7\u00f5es e tempos limite da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disponibiliza seis percursos: Trail Endurance (100 km, tempo limite de 24 horas), Ultra Trail (50 km, limite de 10 horas), Trail Longo (30 km), Trail Sprint (20 km), Mini Trail (12 km) e Caminhada (12 km). A prova tem certifica\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA, pontua para o UTMB Index e integra o Circuito ATRP e o Campeonato Regional de Trail Endurance da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 25 de outubro de 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em tr\u00eas fases (at\u00e9 01\/02, de 02\/02 a 01\/10 e de 02\/10 a 25\/10): Endurance 100 km (60 \u20ac \/ 75 \u20ac \/ 80 \u20ac), Ultra 50 km (30 \u20ac \/ 35 \u20ac \/ 37 \u20ac), Trail Longo 30 km (20 \u20ac \/ 25 \u20ac \/ 27 \u20ac), Trail Sprint 20 km (15 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac \/ 22 \u20ac), Mini Trail 12 km (12 \u20ac \/ 15 \u20ac \/ 17 \u20ac) e Caminhada 12 km (10 \u20ac \/ 12 \u20ac \/ 14 \u20ac). Opcionalmente, \u00e9 poss\u00edvel adquirir a T-shirt Sport HG (12 \u20ac) e meias Sport HG (5 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Futebol Clube de Alvarinhos (Rua do Campo da Bola, n.\u00ba 10, S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o das Lampas) na sexta-feira das 18:00 \u00e0s 22:00 e no s\u00e1bado das 06:00 \u00e0s 09:00. Consoante a dist\u00e2ncia, o material obrigat\u00f3rio inclui copo reutiliz\u00e1vel, telem\u00f3vel operacional e alfinetes\/porta-dorsal para todos os percursos, acrescendo manta t\u00e9rmica (a partir dos 20 km) e mochila, corta-vento, frontal com pilhas de reserva, reserva de \u00e1gua de 1L, alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o e apito nos 50 km e 100 km (e luz traseira nos 100 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelos Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro em Alvarinhos (Sintra). O valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui refei\u00e7\u00e3o, medalha finisher em todas as dist\u00e2ncias, dorsal personalizado (com chip de cronometragem nas provas competitivas), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, duche, seguro desportivo e transporte para a meta em caso de abandono.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-06\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sintra, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Dem\u00f3nios do Lizandro 2026 realiza-se a 6 e 7 de novembro em Sintra. Provas de 100 km, 50 km, 30 km, 20 km, 12 km e Caminhada. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunn